    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">abstract geometric line art with depth, dynamic blue curves and intersecting parallel lines receding into the distance, smooth light gradients and soft shadows on a pale blue background, spatial layering and perspective distortion, minimalistic 3D vector aesthetic, generative design, inspired by Sol LeWitt and Bridget Riley, crisp lines with volumetric illusion --chaos 25 --ar 16:9 --raw --stylize 750 --v 5.1 Job ID: e598ce61-24e6-4622-9bd3-1e7107a75ff7</rdf:li>
